        <activityName xml:lang="en">Shredding, electrical and electronic scrap</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Shredding, electrical and electronic scrap
Data are based on literature. Infrastructure and transportation efforts are based on own assumptions.; UUID: 5e7c9d79-8361-434a-8505-bceea8acb85f
This dataset includes mechanical treatment infrastructure, energy consumption, emissions to air, and an estimation of the efforts for transportation.
Location: Data from a European study, values used as global average data.
Technology: Modern Shredder facility with 2 shredder, 2 magnetic separation &amp; 2 Eddy-current separation steps.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: own estimation
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5e7c9d79-8361-434a-8505-bceea8acb85f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
